      "section_title": "Q.1 Choose the correct answer of the following (any seven) :",
      "total_marks": 2,
      "questions": [
        {
          "id": "q1_1",
          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "<p>A zinc diffusion process is called</p>",
          "options": [
            "galvanizing",
            "anodizing",
            "parkerizing",
            "sherardizing"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "q1_2",
          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "<p>The type of file used for a woodwork is</p>",
          "options": [
            "single-cut file",
            "double-cut file",
            "rasp-cut file",
            "Any one of the above"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "q1_3",
          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "<p>A taper provided on the pattern for its easy and clean withdrawal from the mould is known as</p>",
          "options": [
            "machining allowance",
            "draft allowance",
            "shrinkage allowance",
            "distortion allowance"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "q1_4",
          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "<p>In arc welding, the electric arc is produced between the work and the electrode by</p>",
          "options": [
            "voltage",
            "flow of current",
            "contact resistance",
            "All of the above"
          ],
          "metadata": {
            "stars": 2,
            "freq": 2
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "q1_5",
          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "<p>In a centrifugal casting method</p>",
